# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets and local
# state out of the image.

node_modules
.next
.git
.github

# Local database and uploaded images. These belong on the mounted volume at
# runtime — baking them into the image would ship your local test data to
# production and then have it overwritten on every deploy.
.data

# Secrets. The image must never contain these; the host injects them as
# environment variables instead.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

.vscode
.idea
.claude
npm-debug.log*
README.md
